  scriptLines:
  - Hello, my dear. If you're reading this, then the museum is finally yours. I always
    knew you'd turn it into something special.
  - There are five rooms waiting for your creative touch. Press the number keys 1
    - 5 to walk between them just like I used to. And if you ever want to take it
    all in, press 0 to see the museum from above. It really helps to keep perspective.
